                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "An excellent Indie platformer with steady controls and great soundtrack that will leave you wanting more. Artistic adventure game with unique puzzles. This game truly makes you think and can challenge you. If you like puzzle games you should buy this, it might feel short. but i feel it woth every penny, you can also buy it on steam sale and it is definitely worth your time and money. The game start off with simple puzzles, but they get mind-blending difficult. Really polished controls, good game optimization, pretty good graphics and mesmerizing background music.",
